ttps://api.github.com/users/norepro","html_url":"https://github.com/norepro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T05:13:53Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T05:21:50Z","body":"I agree, they should be consistently styled and the style of horizontal split mode better matches the overall theme. Subjective of course, but for consistency if nothing else.\n\nThe original pull requests that caused the drift (#113574, #114054) were more about scroll hints, not the style directly. This fix keeps the scroll hint improvements and associated border modes but gets the look and feel consistent across the three modes:\n\n| Horizontal split | Vertical split | No split |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| <img width=\"498\" height=\"452\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e2221391-f685-4e23-8cac-ece245b2551d\" /> | <img width=\"498\" height=\"452\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba8ca892-c6c9-4ed0-92ee-137c05d3f57c\" /> | <img width=\"498\" height=\"452\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aeee003b-ea6f-4f8d-a884-863e1e870bc6\" /> |","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4447762742/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4448211668","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119359#issuecomment-4448211668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119359","id":4448211668,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCSJS1A","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T06:28:41Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T06:28:41Z","body":"I'll restate the issues that I brought up on the PR to keep things centralized:\n- Having the background on the single-view mode makes the Filesystem dock break visual consistency with the other ones, which do not have it.\n- I'm less opposed to having the backgrounds in the vertical split-view mode, but the margin needs to be fixed first.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4448211668/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":