g toward just not styling that mode. Consistency is king and many users may not even split the view anyway.\n\nThe lack of margins in the second case is more challenging. I have an initial understanding of the styling, but need to dig more to understand options for this pane.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4448253612/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4450672430","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119359#issuecomment-4450672430","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119359","id":4450672430,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCUffLg","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T12:32:19Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T12:32:19Z","body":"For comparison for `Classic`/`Godot 3` preset:\n\n<img width=\"900\" height=\"700\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22ca8de7-a454-4df9-bb1f-dc556636092e\" />\n\nthere's a mismatch between the background colors (no idea whether it's intentional or just overlooked):\n\n<img width=\"661\" height=\"486\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aeb861b0-fffb-4b02-937a-f11c57efdd93\" />|<img width=\"661\" height=\"486\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a784b0a-a5e7-4f1b-ada8-a6d17958b88d\" />\n-|-\n\nBesides that looks consistent for different split modes:\n\n<img width=\"660\" height=\"646\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1295b50a-8cc2-434b-8fc9-c37ebe0e87a1\" />|<img width=\"660\" height=\"646\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11f38d1d-37ba-4758-b935-4f85b396f86f\" />|<img width=\"660\" height=\"646\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6931462-1150-453c-beee-15c05de8225a\" />\n-|-|-","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4450672430/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4457684273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119359#issuecomment-4457684273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119359","id":4457684273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCbLdMQ","user":{"login":"norepro","id":30921834,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTIxODM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30921834?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro","html_url":"https://github.com/norepro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"ht